  "title": "Was hast du gestern gemacht?",
  "subtitle": "Perfect with haben",
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "type": "overview",
      "label": "Überblick",
      "title": "Lesson intro",
      "minutes": 40,
      "learn": [
        "The spoken past of most verbs is the perfect: haben in position 2, the participle at the end.",
        "Sie hat Fieber gemessen. Wir haben den Befund gelesen. Ich habe Wasser getrunken.",
        "schlafen, essen, trinken, lesen, fragen, nehmen and messen use haben.",
        "Movement such as gehen uses sein. That is a later chapter. Do not say Er hat gegangen."
      ],
